 which was 15 shekels of silver,

1036
00:41:07,640 --> 00:41:09,440
 and then he gets some supplies from the pantry,

1037
00:41:09,440 --> 00:41:11,760
 and food, and barley, and anything that he has to barter,

1038
00:41:11,760 --> 00:41:14,600
 and he goes, "Whatever the price, I will pay it.

1039
00:41:14,600 --> 00:41:15,680
 It's my wife."

1040
00:41:15,680 --> 00:41:17,880
 It's a beautiful story.

1041
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:21,160
 Also, it's a foreshadowing of Jesus' unbreakable,

1042
00:41:21,160 --> 00:41:22,640
 unending love for the church.

1043
00:41:22,640 --> 00:41:27,640
 Whatever the price, even the life of my son, I will pay it.

1044
00:41:27,640 --> 00:41:30,300
 It's amazing.

1045
00:41:30,300 --> 00:41:34,120
 But in the book, there's a prophecy given,

1046
00:41:34,120 --> 00:41:38,920
 where the Lord appears and says, "There will come a day

1047
00:41:38,920 --> 00:41:41,760
 where I will look at those who are not my people,

1048
00:41:41,760 --> 00:41:44,000
 and I will say to not receive mercy,

1049
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:47,280
 you are now the people of God, and I am your God.

1050
00:41:47,280 --> 00:41:48,880
 And you who have not received mercy

1051
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:50,640
 have received my mercy."

1052
00:41:50,640 --> 00:41:53,840
 In Hosea 2, verse 23, "I will have mercy on no mercy.

1053
00:41:53,840 --> 00:41:55,600
 I will say to not my people, you are my people,

1054
00:41:55,600 --> 00:41:57,160
 and he will say, you are my God."

1055
00:41:57,160 --> 00:41:58,440
 He says, "There is a day coming

1056
00:41:58,440 --> 00:42:01,960
 when I will rename the illegitimate and undeserving ones

1057
00:42:01,960 --> 00:42:05,280
 that are born in shame, the ones named after rejection,

1058
00:42:05,280 --> 00:42:06,880
 the ones who had no standing and claim

1059
00:42:06,880 --> 00:42:07,840
 and right on anything."

1060
00:42:07,840 --> 00:42:09,280
 God says, "I'm gonna rename them

1061
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:11,440
 and redefine my relationship with them."

1062
00:42:11,440 --> 00:42:13,800
 And Peter, what's fascinating is Hosea

1063
00:42:13,800 --> 00:42:15,800
 was written to the Jewish nation,

1064
00:42:15,800 --> 00:42:18,840
 but Peter is writing to Gentiles who become Christians now.

1065
00:42:18,840 --> 00:42:21,280
 And he takes that prophecy, this beautiful prophecy

1066
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:22,440
 of these people who were grafted in

1067
00:42:22,440 --> 00:42:24,040
 despite the fact that they weren't deserving of it,

1068
00:42:24,040 --> 00:42:27,000
 and he says, "This is now yours."

1069
00:42:28,800 --> 00:42:30,920
 That God has done this for you,

1070
00:42:30,920 --> 00:42:33,080
 that you were not receiving of mercy

1071
00:42:33,080 --> 00:42:36,480
 or deserving of mercy, and you have been given mercy.

1072
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:38,080
 You are not a part of God's people,

1073
00:42:38,080 --> 00:42:39,480
 and now you are the people of God,

1074
00:42:39,480 --> 00:42:41,160
 which is why all the different phrases,

1075
00:42:41,160 --> 00:42:43,080
 the royal priesthood, a holy nation,

1076
00:42:43,080 --> 00:42:45,360
 those are all descriptive terms from Exodus 19

1077
00:42:45,360 --> 00:42:46,940
 for the nation of Israel.

1078
00:42:46,940 --> 00:42:50,960
 He says, "Those now apply to you."

1079
00:42:50,960 --> 00:42:53,360
 And then he ends with saying,

1080
00:42:53,360 --> 00:42:54,680
 "And now we can tell the world,

1081
00:42:54,680 --> 00:42:57,480
 there's a God who calls people out of darkness

1082
00:42:57,480 --> 00:42:59,560
 and calls the darkness out of those people,

1083
00:42:59,560 --> 00:43:02,160
 like me and like you and like everyone you've ever met."

1084
00:43:02,160 --> 00:43:03,360
 And he wants a relationship with them,

1085
00:43:03,360 --> 00:43:04,840
 and he says, "Now you go tell people,

1086
00:43:04,840 --> 00:43:07,000
 go tell the message of Christ to the world around him,

1087
00:43:07,000 --> 00:43:09,400
 tell your coworker at work who's sitting next to you tomorrow,

1088
00:43:09,400 --> 00:43:11,360
 tell the person on the plane that God has put you

1089
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:12,720
 sitting with for the next hour,

1090
00:43:12,720 --> 00:43:14,920
 tell the family member who thinks they're too far gone

1091
00:43:14,920 --> 00:43:18,920
 and too far broken, there is a God who rewrites names,

1092
00:43:18,920 --> 00:43:23,380
 who changes stories, who adopts the undeserving,

1093
00:43:25,400 --> 00:43:30,000
 did so most clearly and emphatically at the cross,

1094
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:34,520
 where he redefined humanity's ability

1095
00:43:34,520 --> 00:43:35,600
 to have a relationship with them,

1096
00:43:35,600 --> 00:43:38,400
 and now he's invited us to be part of sharing that

1097
00:43:38,400 --> 00:43:39,760
 with the world around you.

1098
00:43:39,760 --> 00:43:44,760
 And when you do, you experience your purpose.

1099
00:43:44,760 --> 00:43:48,160
 Let me pray.

1100
00:43:50,760 --> 00:43:55,760
 Father, I thank you that the staggering love

1101
00:43:55,760 --> 00:44:02,740
 modeled by Jose to his wife pales in comparison,

1102
00:44:02,740 --> 00:44:09,600
 is an incomplete depiction of your unending,

1103
00:44:09,600 --> 00:44:15,880
 unbreakable love for your bride, the church.

1104
00:44:15,880 --> 00:44:20,140
 Tonight, anyone who's never trusted in you with that change,

1105
00:44:21,760 --> 00:44:23,000
 for those of us who have, God,

1106
00:44:23,000 --> 00:44:25,720
 would you help us have the courage,

1107
00:44:25,720 --> 00:44:33,480
 the intentionality to grow in our faith,

1108
00:44:33,480 --> 00:44:36,440
 to grow and prioritize pursuing you,

1109
00:44:36,440 --> 00:44:38,280
 to walk deeper in our relationship with you,

1110
00:44:38,280 --> 00:44:39,600
 every one of us.

1111
00:44:39,600 --> 00:44:43,560
 God, we just, we declare we wanna be more like you

1112
00:44:43,560 --> 00:44:46,280
 a year from now than we are right now,

1113
00:44:46,280 --> 00:44:47,440
 and we need your help.

1114
00:44:50,280 --> 00:44:53,160
 Father, would you allow us to move towards community

1115
00:44:53,160 --> 00:44:54,000
 if we don't have it yet,

1116
00:44:54,000 --> 00:44:55,600
 to be connected to other believers,

1117
00:44:55,600 --> 00:44:59,680
 and experience how you designed life to function

1118
00:44:59,680 --> 00:45:02,240
 as image bearers, created the image of the Trinity.

1119
00:45:02,240 --> 00:45:06,760
 And God, would you give us courage to open our mouth,

1120
00:45:06,760 --> 00:45:09,320
 share that there is a world that is bound for hell,

1121
00:45:09,320 --> 00:45:15,080
 and we've been given the keys of eternal life

1122
00:45:15,080 --> 00:45:17,480
 to use the New Testament language of Matthew 16,

1123
00:45:18,840 --> 00:45:21,680
 that we're now to extend to a world

1124
00:45:21,680 --> 00:45:24,440
 in desperate need of them.

1125
00:45:24,440 --> 00:45:26,560
 And we just confess sometimes, God,

1126
00:45:26,560 --> 00:45:30,040
 we're distracted, we're cowardice,

1127
00:45:30,040 --> 00:45:33,120
 and we need your help.

1128
00:45:33,120 --> 00:45:35,800
 So would you enable your servants to speak your word

1129
00:45:35,800 --> 00:45:38,080
 with great boldness, as you say in Acts chapter four,

1130
00:45:38,080 --> 00:45:40,520
 as you stretch your hand out and do wonders in amidst.

1131
00:45:40,520 --> 00:45:41,600
 I pray for this ministry.

1132
00:45:41,600 --> 00:45:42,800
 God, continue to bless it.

1133
00:45:42,800 --> 00:45:44,040
 Thank you for the way you are.

1134
00:45:44,040 --> 00:45:46,480
 Strengthen and raise up the next generation of men

1135
00:45:46,480 --> 00:45:48,280
 who will say, "Though none go with me,

1136
00:45:48,280 --> 00:45:50,040
 "I will follow Jesus."

1137
00:45:50,040 --> 00:45:53,360
 Father, would you help us?

1138
00:45:53,360 --> 00:45:55,760
 We love you.

1139
00:45:55,760 --> 00:45:56,760
 We worship you now in song.

1140
00:45:56,760 --> 00:45:57,600
 Amen.

